Options -Indexes

# SA-2 (2026-09) -- public/ is a static-asset directory (css/js/images/
# uploads); no PHP script here should ever execute via a direct browser
# request. This closes a stray, orphaned view file
# (income-statement-index.php) that has no controller/route reference and
# would otherwise throw raw PHP errors -- potentially disclosing internal
# path/constant names -- if requested directly. It also hardens
# uploads/ against a hypothetical future upload-then-execute bypass.
<FilesMatch "\.php$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
